Graphics:</strong> Integrated<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":true,"mac":false,"windows":true},"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","discount_percent":0,"final":499,"final_formatted":"$4.99 USD","initial":499,"initial_formatted":""},"publishers":["WINTERYEAR Studios Los Angeles"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"esrb":{"rating":"e"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"5 May, 2022"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cNew Terra kept me occupied while effortlessly combining a need for precision with cutthroat difficulty. The game is fair and offers a great challenge... The fantastic soundtrack and fine-tuned controls far outweigh any graphical issues....  The soundtrack and finely tuned controls elevated the game as a whole, and it\u2019s definitely a solid title for the right audience... New Terra is a very encouraging start for WINTERYEAR Studios.\u201d<br>8.5/10 \u2013 Handheld Gaming Community<br><br>\u201cLong anticipated and worth the wait! Smooth game play, really beautiful poster-ready artwork, great music. Surprising attention to detail and some pretty cool little touches, from the running men graphic to the one liners like &quot;stop touching stuff with your ship.&quot; It's a fun game but challenging - luckily the difficulty settings are your friend, especially when your fuel level is not. Action is kind of reminiscent of traditional arcade games but way cooler. Looking forward to more from this developer.\u201d<br>10/10 \u2013 Metacritic<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1806860/ss_97a963dc82dd79da68d91153093eb95ee836fe69.1920x1080.jpg?t=1660795708","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1806860/ss_97a963dc82dd79da68d91153093eb95ee836fe69.600x338.jpg?t=1660795708"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1806860/ss_1772aa5ceafc1ea6026b5e325ea0e600d361a119.1920x1080.jpg?t=1660795708","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1806860/ss_1772aa5ceafc1ea6026b5e325ea0e600d361a119.600x338.jpg?t=1660795708"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1806860/ss_d89b36bcd92dfe8b107e9945ad7e54dc04f769f4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1660795708","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1806860/ss_d89b36bcd92dfe8b107e9945ad7e54dc04f769f4.600x338.jpg?t=1660795708"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1806860/ss_7faff341f9cfcce0875f54ba7c98fdf68ded10d4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1660795708","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1806860/ss_7faff341f9cfcce0875f54ba7c98fdf68ded10d4.600x338.jpg?t=1660795708"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1806860/ss_2f1e28ef95ad02137cee276e2a5cd13ea38f20ea.1920x1080.jpg?t=1660795708","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1806860/ss_2f1e28ef95ad02137cee276e2a5cd13ea38f20ea.600x338.jpg?t=1660795708"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1806860/ss_c6baed0c9dec86869b51ce512e5231bfd2c0ffd8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1660795708","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1806860/ss_c6baed0c9dec86869b51ce512e5231bfd2c0ffd8.600x338.jpg?t=1660795708"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1806860/ss_62aa45bfb933c8e411473427eb1ab9d3d32307a5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1660795708","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1806860/ss_62aa45bfb933c8e411473427eb1ab9d3d32307a5.600x338.jpg?t=1660795708"},{"id":7,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1806860/ss_438e02b77e21b6f5292cce4216b3973724a5e4b4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1660795708","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1806860/ss_438e02b77e21b6f5292cce4216b3973724a5e4b4.600x338.jpg?t=1660795708"}],"short_description":"NEW TERRA is a challenging and addictive multi-directional gravity-based space shooter. Fuel goes fast and is hard to come by. Hauling cargo makes your ship very heavy and mobility becomes limited. Strategy and resource conservation is key to completing your missions or you won't survive.","steam_appid":1806860,"support_info":{"email":"newterra.support@winteryear.com","url":"www.winteryear.com"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Arabic, Dutch, Finnish, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Swedish, Italian, Polish, Romanian, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://www.newterragame.com"}